4K Vention ALEHG\/ HDMI Macho - HDMI Macho\/ 1.5m\/ Gris","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"<p><ul>  <li><b>Especificaciones<\/b><\/li>  <li>El cable vention slim hdmi 2.0 tiene una alta velocidad, es la soluci\u00f3n a diferentes necesidades que tienes en tus momentos de ocio y trabajo del d\u00eda a d\u00eda.<\/li><li>Con materiales de primera calidad, este cable permite un alto rendimiento de tus actividades durante un largo periodo de tiempo.<\/li>  <li>Te permite disfrutar de la mejor calidad de audio y video que tu dispositivo puede ofrecer<\/li>  <li>Tasa de transferencia de datos de hasta 18 gb<\/li>  <li>Amplia compatibilidad<\/li>  <li>Plug and play<\/li>  <li>Admite resoluci\u00f3n 4k: permite resoluciones de video mucho m\u00e1s all\u00e1 de 1080p.<\/li>  <li>Cable delgado<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"VENTION","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.05,"unit_price":8.2,"unit_price_tax":8.2,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cables","sub_category":"Cables HDMI","quantity":5,"brand":"VENTION","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_ven-cab%20alehg_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":3.2}}},"6922794764538":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["6922794764538",false],"wholesale_price":[2.75,false],"price":[7.75,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.05",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:154391","Cat. IDs: 68","Associated Categories"