o<\/li><li>Protecci\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica contra sobrecalentamiento<\/li><li>Anilla para colgar que permite guardarlo f\u00e1cilmente<\/li><li>Conmutaci\u00f3n de tensi\u00f3n 100-120 \/ 220-240 V (1200\/1600 vatios) para uso universal<\/li><li>Filtro de seguridad extra\u00edble para facilitar la limpieza<\/li><li>Boquilla profesional estrecha<\/li><li>Superficie soft touch<\/li><\/ul><br><p><\/p><ul><li><b>Especificaciones<\/b><\/li><li>Denominaci\u00f3n del producto Secador de pelo de viaje<\/li><li>Filtro extra\u00edble S\u00ed<\/li><li>Accesorios 1<\/li><li>Particularidad Funci\u00f3n de iones, plegable<\/li><li>Motor de CC S\u00ed<\/li><li>Niveles de funcionamiento 2 niveles de calor y 2 niveles de velocidad<\/li><li>Funci\u00f3n de iones S\u00ed<\/li><li>Potencia en vatios 1600<\/li><li>Protecci\u00f3n contra sobrecalentamiento S\u00ed<\/li><li>Uso universal S\u00ed<\/li><li>Peso del producto Aprox. 426 g<\/li><li>Dimensiones del producto (la. x an. x al.) 15,8 x 8,0 x 25,9 cm<\/li><li>CE S\u00ed<\/li><\/ul><\/p>                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"BEURER","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":21,"unit_price_tax":21,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cuidado Personal","sub_category":"Secadores","quantity":0,"brand":"BEURER","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_beu-pae-sec%20hc-25-le_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":16}}},"8712836980730":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8712836980730",false],"wholesale_price":[2.82,false],"price":[7.82,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"im